(7730016, 1272838, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> WOW, that is amazing! Why have a camera if you can take photos like that with a phone. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The phone IS a camera, and a very good one. I think of it as a camera with phone and android functions built-in. It''s the only reason I upgrade phones, is for better cameras :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: WOW, that is amazing! Why have a camera if you can take photos like that with a phone.  The phone IS a camera, and a very good one. I think of it as a camera with phone and android functions built-in. It''s the only reason I upgrade phones, is for better cameras :-)', '2022-09-21 01:08:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730017, 1272838, 104230, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  We are blessed with interesting clouds around these parts aren''t we, including ones we can photograph from our doorstep!</td>', 'Congrats!  We are blessed with interesting clouds around these parts aren''t we, including ones we can photograph from our doorstep!', '2022-09-21 01:20:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730019, 1272970, 119705, '<td valign="top">On this day the moon rise was right around the same time as the sunset. So it was still daylight but more twilight. More daylight than this photo looks actually. The sky was a beautiful pink and orange behind me. Unfortunately, it was the only time during the challenge dates I could shoot the moon.</td>', 'On this day the moon rise was right around the same time as the sunset. So it was still daylight but more twilight. More daylight than this photo looks actually. The sky was a beautiful pink and orange behind me. Unfortunately, it was the only time during the challenge dates I could shoot the moon.', '2022-09-21 01:46:44.000000', NULL, 0),
