(7730046, 1272977, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really liked this, the lines and then the moon; the grittiness, which actually imparts a confident delicacy; the richness of color; the cloud bleeding upwards, then downwards, to mingle with the city; the flat moon.  Could be the opening sentence of a transcendent novel.  Fine title.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge - the 8, of course.</td>', 'Really liked this, the lines and then the moon; the grittiness, which actually imparts a confident delicacy; the richness of color; the cloud bleeding upwards, then downwards, to mingle with the city; the flat moon.  Could be the opening sentence of a transcendent novel.  Fine title.Personal favorite of the challenge - the 8, of course.', '2022-09-21 17:17:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730115, 1272975, 91360, '<td valign="top">Nothing special ..great image! love the relations here. (gave it an 8):)</td>', 'Nothing special ..great image! love the relations here. (gave it an 8):)', '2022-09-22 01:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
